Upstream source and copyright notices are preserved under upstream/.
The upstream Apache License 2.0 follows this notice in the application.

Modifications for Mangaku: the source logic is compiled into the application,
uses native Android networking and JSON, and is connected to Mangaku's local
library, chapter reader and downloader. It does not load extension APKs.
The adapted implementation is in runtime/src/com/mangaku/local/.
